## Technology Stack

| Layer | Technology | Rationale |
|-------|-----------|-----------|
| **Language** | Java 21 (LTS) | Records, sealed classes, virtual threads |
| **Backend** | Spring Boot 3.3 + Spring Modulith | Modular monolith with enforced boundaries |
| **API** | REST (OpenAPI/Swagger) | Standard, well-documented |
| **Database** | PostgreSQL 16 | JSONB for flexible data, strong relational integrity |
| **Cache** | Redis | Session management, real-time notifications, caching |
| **ORM** | Spring Data JPA + Hibernate 6 | Type-safe queries, automatic auditing |
| **Migrations** | Flyway | Version-controlled schema migrations |
| **Security** | Spring Security + JWT | Stateless auth, RBAC + scope-based access |
| **Validation** | Jakarta Bean Validation | Declarative input validation |
| **PDF** | iText / OpenPDF | Quotation & invoice PDF generation |
| **Frontend** | React 18 + Vite + TypeScript | Fast builds, rich ERP UI |
| **UI Library** | Ant Design / Shadcn | Enterprise-grade components |
| **State** | TanStack Query + Zustand | Server-state caching + lightweight global state |
| **Charts** | Recharts / Apache ECharts | Dashboards & analytics |
| **Build** | Maven (multi-module) | Proven Java build system |
| **Testing** | JUnit 5 + Mockito + Testcontainers | Unit + integration with real Postgres |
| **Docs** | OpenAPI 3.0 (Springdoc) | Auto-generated API docs |
| **DevOps** | Docker + Docker Compose | Consistent dev/prod environments |

