## Security Architecture — RBAC + Scope-Based Access

### Role Hierarchy

```
SUPER_ADMIN
    └── ADMIN
        ├── FINANCE_MANAGER
        ├── EVENT_MANAGER
        │   └── EVENT_HEAD
        │       └── TEAM_HEAD
        │           └── TEAM_MEMBER
        └── INVENTORY_MANAGER
VENDOR (External role — limited portal access)
```

### Scope-Based Access Control

Beyond roles, each user's access is scoped:

```java
// Example: SecurityScope
record SecurityScope(
    Role role,
    Set<Long> allowedEventIds,    // null = all events
    Set<Long> allowedTeamIds,     // null = all teams
    Set<String> moduleAccess      // e.g., ["CRM", "SALES", "EVENTS"]
) {}
```

| Role | CRM | Sales | Events | Teams | Vendors | Tasks | Hampers | Finance | Reports |
|------|-----|-------|--------|-------|---------|-------|---------|---------|---------|
| **Admin** | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |
| **Finance Manager** | 👁️ | ✅ | 👁️ | ❌ | 👁️ | ❌ | 👁️ | ✅ | ✅ |
| **Event Manager** | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | 👁️ | 👁️ | ✅ |
| **Event Head** | 👁️ | 👁️ | ✅* | ✅* | ✅* | ✅* | 👁️ | ❌ | 👁️ |
| **Team Head** | ❌ | ❌ | 👁️* | ✅* | 👁️* | ✅* | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ |
| **Team Member** | ❌ | ❌ | 👁️* | 👁️* | ❌ | ✅* | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ |
| **Vendor** | ❌ | ❌ | 👁️* | ❌ | 👁️* | 👁️* | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ |

*✅* = only assigned items, 👁️ = read-only, 👁️* = read-only for assigned items*

